---
const steps = [
  {
    title: 'You open your own account',
    description:
      'You deposit funds into a trading account that is opened and controlled entirely by you, never by Fortitude International.',
  },
  {
    title: 'We link it, not withdraw it',
    description:
      'Your account is linked to our master trading account, allowing our traders to trade on your behalf using an allocation structure.',
  },
  {
    title: 'Trade-only access for our traders',
    description:
      'Our traders can place trades across linked accounts, but have no ability to withdraw, transfer, or otherwise remove funds from your account.',
  },
  {
    title: 'You keep withdrawal control',
    description:
      'Only you can withdraw funds from your account, at any time. Your capital is never pooled into a vehicle you don’t control.',
  },
];
---

<section id="security" class="relative bg-ink-2 py-28">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 lg:px-10">
    <div class="grid gap-16 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:items-center">
      <div class="reveal order-2 lg:order-1">
        <div class="space-y-6">
          {steps.map((step, i) => (
            <div class="flex gap-5 rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-panel p-6 transition-colors hover:border-gold/30">
              <span class="flex h-9 w-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-gold/50 font-display text-sm text-gold">
                {i + 1}
              </span>
              <div>
                <h3 class="font-display text-lg text-paper">{step.title}</h3>
                <p class="mt-1.5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ash">{step.description}</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          ))}
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="reveal order-1 lg:order-2">
        <p class="mb-4 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-gold">
          Security &amp; Control
        </p>
        <h2 class="text-balance font-display text-4xl font-medium leading-tight text-paper sm:text-5xl">
          Your capital stays
          <span class="text-gold">in your hands.</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-6 text-balance text-lg leading-relaxed text-ash">
          Trust is the foundation of everything we do. That's why the structure of
          every investment is built around a simple principle: our traders can
          trade your capital, but they can never take it.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-4 text-balance text-lg leading-relaxed text-ash">
          Funds are deposited into an account that you open and control. It is then
          linked to our main trading account so our team can execute trades on your
          behalf. Withdrawal rights remain with you, and you alone, at all
          times.
        </p>

        <div class="mt-8 rounded-xl border border-gold/30 bg-ink p-6">
          <p class="font-display text-lg text-gold">No pooled custody. No exceptions.</p>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ash">
            Your funds are never transferred into an account controlled by Fortitude
            International or its traders.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
